# Portable `.agent/` contracts are committed in generated projects.
#
# Operational/local paths are ignored by the generated root `.gitignore`:
# - active-work-block.json
# - critic-gate.md
# - verification-gate.md
# - project-config.md
#
# Keep this file pattern-free so it cannot override the profile-aware root
# tracking boundary or hide bootstrap-profile.json, the blocked default Work
# Block, shared hooks, workflows, roster, or selected skills.
